## 1. SERP Intent Analysis

### 1a. Dominant Content Format

The top results are uniformly **numbered listicles structured as practical how-to guides**. Every competitor (Greystar, Moving Help, Azibo, Draper & Kramer, Bear Property Management, Apartment Guide) presents a numbered or bulleted list of questions organized under categorical H2 headers. The format is: brief intro, question-category H2s, individual questions with 1-3 sentence explanations per question, closing summary.

**The article must match this format:** A categorically organized question list with short explanatory copy under each question. Pure listicle with zero narrative filler. This is not the place for essay-style prose.

